{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_1","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"穆宗孝安敬正皇帝，諱璟，小字述律。太宗皇帝長子，母曰靖安皇后蕭氏。會同二年，封壽安王。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_2","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"天祿五年秋九月癸亥，世宗遇害。逆臣察割等伏誅。丁卯，即皇帝位，羣臣上尊號曰天順皇帝，改元應曆。戊辰，如南京。是月，遣劉承訓告哀于漢。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_3","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"冬十一月，漢、周、南唐各遣使來弔。乙亥，詔朝會依嗣聖皇帝故事，用漢禮。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_4","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"十二月甲辰，漢遣使獻弓矢、鞍馬。壬子，鐵驪、鼻骨德皆來貢。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_5","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"二年春正月戊午朔，南唐遣使奉蠟丸書，及進犀兕甲萬屬。壬戌，太尉忽古質謀逆，伏誅。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_6","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"二月癸卯，女直來貢。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_7","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"三月癸亥，南唐遣使奉蠟丸書。丁卯，復遣使來貢。甲申，以耶律撻烈為南院大王。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_8","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"夏四月丙戌朔，日有食之。己亥，鐵驪進鷹鶻。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_9","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"五月丙辰朔，視朝。壬午，南唐遣使來貢。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_10","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"六月壬辰，國舅政事令蕭眉古得、宣政殿學士李澣等謀南奔，事覺，詔暴其罪。乙未，祭天地。壬寅，漢為周所侵，遣使求援，命中臺省右相高模翰赴之。丁未，命乳媼之兄曷魯世為阿速石烈夷離菫。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_11","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"秋七月乙亥，政事令婁國、林牙敵烈、侍中神都、郎君海里等謀亂就執。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_12","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"八月己丑，眉古得、婁國等伏誅，杖李澣而釋之。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_13","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"九月甲寅朔，雲州進嘉禾四莖，二穗。戊午，詔以先平察割日，用白黑羊、玄酒祭天，歲以為常。壬戌，獵炭山。祭天。庚辰，敵烈部來貢。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_14","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"冬十月甲申朔，漢遣使進葡萄酒。甲午，司徒老古等獻白雉。戊申，回鶻及轄戞斯皆遣使來貢。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_15","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"十一月癸丑朔，視朝。己巳，地震。己卯，日南至，始用舊制行拜日禮。朔州民進黑兔。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_16","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"十二月癸未朔，高模翰及漢兵圍晉州。辛卯，以生日，飯僧，釋繫囚。甲辰，獵于近郊。祀天地。辛亥，明王安端薨。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_17","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"三年春閏正月壬午朔，漢以高模翰却周軍，遣使來謝。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_18","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"二月辛亥朔，詔用嗣聖皇帝舊璽。甲子，太保敵烈修易州城，鎮州以兵來挑戰，却之。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_19","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"三月庚辰朔，南唐遣使來貢，因附書于漢，詔達之。庚寅，如應州擊鞠。丁酉，漢遣使進毬衣及馬。庚子，觀漁於神德湖。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_20","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"夏四月庚申，鐵驪來貢。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_21","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"五月壬寅，漢遣使言石晉樹先帝聖德神功碑為周人所毀，請再刻，許之。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_22","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"六月丁卯，應天皇太后崩。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_23","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"秋七月，不視朝。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_24","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"八月壬子，以生日，釋囚。己未，漢遣使求援。三河烏古、吐蕃、吐谷渾、鼻骨德皆遣使來貢。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_25","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"九月庚子，漢遣使貢藥。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_26","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"冬十月己酉，命太師唐骨德治大行皇太后園陵。李胡子宛、郎君嵇幹、敵烈謀反，事覺，辭逮太平王罨撒葛、林牙華割、郎君新羅等，皆執之。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_27","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"十一月辛丑，諡皇太后曰貞烈，葬祖陵。漢遣使來會。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_28","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"是冬，駐蹕奉聖州。以南京水，詔免今歲租。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_29","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"四年春正月戊寅，回鶻來貢。己丑，華割、嵇幹等伏誅，宛及罨撒葛皆釋之。是月，周主威殂，養子晉王柴榮嗣立。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_30","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"二月丙午朔，周攻漢，命政事令耶律敵祿援之。丙辰，漢遣使進茶藥。幸南京。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_31","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"夏五月乙亥，忻、代二州叛漢，遣南院大王撻烈助敵祿討之。丁酉，撻烈敗周將符彥卿於忻口。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_32","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"六月癸亥，撻烈獻所獲。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_33","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"秋七月乙酉，漢民有為遼軍誤掠者，遣使來請，詔悉歸之。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_34","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"九月丙申，漢為周人所侵，遣使來告。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_35","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"冬十一月，彰國軍節度使蕭敵烈、大保許從贇奏忻、代二州捷。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_36","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"十二月辛酉朔，謁祖陵。庚午，漢遣使來貢。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_37","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"是冬，駐蹕杏堝。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_38","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"五年春正月辛未朔，鼻骨德來貢。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_39","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"二月庚子朔，日有食之。庚申，漢遣使請上尊號，不許。壬戌，如褭潭。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_40","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"夏四月己酉，周侵漢，漢遣使求援。癸丑，命郎君蕭海瓈世為北府宰相。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_41","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"秋九月庚辰，漢主有疾，遣使來告。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_42","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"冬十月壬申，女直來貢。丁亥，謁太宗廟。庚寅，南唐遣使來貢。","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_43","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"十一月乙未朔，漢主崇殂，子承鈞遣使來告，且求嗣立；遣使弔祭，遂封冊之。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_44","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"十二月乙丑朔，謁太祖廟。辛巳，漢遣使來議軍事。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_45","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"六年夏五月丁酉，謁懷陵。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_46","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"六月甲子，漢遣使來議軍事。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_47","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"秋七月，不視朝。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_48","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"九月戊午，謁祖陵。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_49","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"冬十一月壬寅，鼻骨德來貢。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_50","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"十二月己未朔，謁太祖廟。","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_51","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"七年春正月庚子，鼻骨德來貢。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_52","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"二月辛酉，南唐遣使奉蠟丸書。辛未，駐蹕潢河。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_53","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"夏四月戊午朔，還上京。初，女巫肖古上延年藥方，當用男子膽和之。不數年，殺人甚多。至是，覺其妄。辛巳，射殺之。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_54","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"五月辛卯，漢遣使來貢。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_55","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"六月丙辰朔，周遣使來聘。南唐遣使來貢。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_56","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"八月己未，周遣使來聘。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_57","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"是秋，不聽政。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_58","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"冬十月庚申，獵于七鷹山。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_59","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"十二月丁巳，詔大臣曰：「有罪者，法當刑。朕或肆怒，濫及無辜，卿等切諫，無或面從。」辛巳，還上京。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_60","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"八年春二月乙丑，駐蹕潢河。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_61","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"夏四月甲寅，南京留守蕭思溫攻下沿邊州縣，遣人勞之。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_62","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"五月，周陷束城縣。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_63","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"六月辛未，蕭思溫請益兵，乞駕幸燕。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_64","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"秋七月，獵于拽剌山。迄于九月，射鹿諸山，不視朝。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_65","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"冬十一月辛酉，漢遣使來告周復來侵。乙丑，使再至。","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_66","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"十二月庚辰，又至。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_67","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"九年春正月戊辰，駐蹕潢河。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_68","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"夏四月丙戌，周來侵。戊戌，以南京留守蕭思溫為兵馬都總管擊之。是月，周拔益津、瓦橋、淤口三關。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_69","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"五月乙巳朔，陷瀛、莫二州。癸亥，如南京。辛未，周兵退。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_70","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"六月乙亥朔，視朝。戊寅，復容城縣。庚申，西幸，如懷州。是月，周主榮殂，子宗訓立。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_71","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"秋七月，發南京軍戍范陽。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_72","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"冬十二月戊寅，還上京。庚辰，王子敵烈、前宣徽使海思及蕭達干等謀反，事覺，鞫之。辛巳，祀天地、祖考，告逆黨事敗。丙申，召羣臣議時政。","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_73","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"十年春正月，周殿前都點檢趙匡胤廢周自立，建國號宋。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_74","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"夏五月乙巳，謁懷陵。壬子，漢以潞州歸附來告。丙寅，至自懷陵。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_75","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"六月庚申，漢以宋兵圍石州來告，遣大同軍節度使阿剌率四部往援，詔蕭思溫以三部兵助之。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_76","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"秋七月己亥朔，宋兵陷石州，潞州復叛，漢使來告。辛酉，政事令耶律壽遠、太保楚阿不等謀反，伏誅。以酒脯祠天地于黑山。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_77","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"八月，如秋山，幸懷州。庚午，以鎮茵石狻猊擊殺近侍古哥。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_78","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"冬十月丙子，李胡子喜隱謀反，辭連李胡，下獄死。","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_79","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"十一月，海思獄中上書，陳便宜。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_80","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"十一年春二月丙寅，釋喜隱。辛亥，司徒烏里只子迭剌哥誣告其父謀反，復詐乘傳及殺行人，以其父請，杖而釋之。","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_81","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"三月丙辰，思溫奏老人星見，乞行赦宥。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_82","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"閏月甲子朔，如潢河。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_83","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"夏四月癸巳朔，日有食之。是月，射鹿，不視朝。","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_84","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"五月乙亥，司天王白、李正等進曆。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_85","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"六月甲午，赦。","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_86","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"冬十一月，歲星犯月。","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_87","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"十二年春正月甲戌，夜觀燈。","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_88","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"二月己丑朔，以御史大夫蕭護思為北院樞密使，賜對衣、鞍馬。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_89","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"夏五月庚午，以旱，命左右以水相沃，頃之，果雨。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_90","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"六月甲午，祠木葉山及潢河。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_91","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"秋，如黑山、赤山射鹿。","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_92","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"十三年春正月，自丁巳，晝夜酣飲者九日。丙寅，宋欲城益津關，命南京留守高勳、統軍使崔廷勳以兵擾之。癸酉，殺獸人海里。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_93","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"二月庚寅，漢遣使來告，欲巡邊徼，乞張聲援。壬辰，如潢河。癸巳，觀羣臣射，賜物有差。乙巳，老人星見。","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_94","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"三月癸丑朔，殺鹿人彌里吉，梟其首以示掌鹿者。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_95","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"夏四月壬寅，獵于潢河。","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_96","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"五月壬戌，視斡朗改國所進花鹿生麛。","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_97","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"六月癸未，近侍傷獐，杖殺之。甲申，殺獐人霞馬。壬辰，詔諸路錄囚。","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_98","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"秋七月辛亥朔，漢以宋侵來告。乙丑，薦時羞於廟。","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_99","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"八月甲申，以生日，縱五坊鷹鶻。戊戌，幸近山，呼鹿射之，旬有七日而後返。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_100","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"九月庚戌朔，以青牛白馬祭天地。飲于野次，終夕乃罷。辛亥，以酒脯祭天地，復終夜酣飲。","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_101","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"冬十月丙申，漢以宋侵來告。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_102","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"十一月庚午，獵，飲于虞人之家，凡四日。","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_6_103","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_6","textTraditional":"十二月戊子，射野鹿，賜虞人物有差。庚寅，殺彘人曷主。","sentenceOrder":103}],"overrides":{}}